  <result aggregation-status="1" type="9">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Unions have increased the number of women in leadership positions</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">TUs and LROs will be able to voice their concerns without fearing violence or restrictions. In an expanded civic space, TUs advance workers&#x2019; rights, especially FoA and the right to decent work. TUs and LROs in production countries are free to organise unions or worker-representative organisations, with women in leadership. TUs and LROs use evidence-based L&amp;A to change national laws and legislation on working conditions and workers&#x2019; rights.</narrative>
